WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:36.700
I'm Kurata Sana,
TV personality and 6th grader.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:40.370
Mama, an Aoki Laureate novelist.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.450
My natural enemy and good friend,
Hayama Akito.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.410
I don't really understand him.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.330
My chauffer and manager,

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.080
who used to be my boyfriend and pimp,
Rei-kun. However...

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.670
Love had at last come
to an end for our heroine.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.470
What fate awaits Kurata Sana?

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:01.100
What's between you and Sagami-kun,
quite frankly, is not love!

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:06.730
I'm so... terribly embarrassed!

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.650
I'll be all right, so...

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:22.410
"Father, You Are His Father"

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.040
Oh? You're not sleeping with Sagami-kun?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.500
Nope. We've broken up, after all.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.290
From now on, ours is just
a business relationship.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.630
My daughter-- she suffers disgrace,
and waxes older.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:37.970
Not far hence is summer.
Hark! We must devote ourselves...

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.640
Oh, Mama, don't fire Rei-kun or anything.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.260
Yeah, yeah, cha-cha, hey, cha-cha!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.650
Waah! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.650
All righty!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.650
Good morning, Shimura-san!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.320
Oh, dear, Sana-chan, you're late.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.320
Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.990
This won't do, Sana-chan!
You have to get up earlier!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.990
...Says Rei-kun,
who also slept in, right?

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:05.990
Stop criticizing and let's
pull out of here, all right!?

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.830
--The next day,
--After school today, you have an
Odabutsu-land commercial to shoot.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.170
I became awfully busy.
--Zenjiro-san is scheduled to come, too.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.330
--I didn't even have time
--Once that's done, there's a
planning meeting tomorrow

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.340
--for a heart-to-heart chat
--for a Bocari Sweet commercial.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.960
--with Rei-kun.
--We'll decide on the wardrobe
while we're there...

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.720
--Now, shooting six commercials
--Whoa! That was close!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.010
--may be a bit rough...
--I almost forgot my gym clothes!

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.680
...but as a performer,
Sana-chan, I'm sure--

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.180
I'm off--

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:27.680
See you later!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.350
Uh, Sana-chan,
about what I was just saying...

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.350
Okay, okay!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:33.980
Sana-chan, with you fully showing off
your talents as a performer,

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:38.990
and, with me, uh, as your manager, um,
as the finest manager in all of Japan...

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.650
She's not listening.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.650
Flashback!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.610
"6 commercials!?"

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.660
What's this!?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.410
You're kidding! Why this all of a sudden?
Six commercials in one week?

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:53.330
No, no, including Gleco's Ice
Regular spot, it's seven.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.670
S- seven!?

00:03:55.670 --> 00:04:00.670
Sana-chan, I failed you as a boyfriend.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:05.340
So I've made the decision to at least
go on being a good manager for you.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.680
You're a reject as a manager, too!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.350
--Uh, still, for you to be a performer
that the crowds will love in the future,
--Seven... seven commercials...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.350
--I, Sagami Rei, will work my
hardest to do all that I can...
--Aah, I've never done that before...

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.980
She's not listening.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.360
What's the use? I'll do them.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.070
Thank you!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.700
"And so, having said that..."

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.370
Sana-chan, let's play.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.700
You don't have either "Child's Toy"
or Komawari today, right?

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.960
Sorry, I have to shoot
a commercial today.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.620
Wow, you've got more work?

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.500
You'll have to forgive me.
My brilliant manager

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.630
has booked an inexhaustible
supply of work for me to do.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.630
Sana-chan, you've been a rather
unsociable little duck lately.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.970
You're right. But I'll
take care of it all in no time!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.640
Next time, I'll overturn it,
and we can all play together with a bang!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:47.640
No, you don't have to go that far.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.310
You don't need to overturn anything.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.640
Oh, there goes my Burutcha.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.980
Aya-chan, Hisae-chan,
I'll see you later.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.270
"Unsociable!"

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:58.310
Oh, I wonder if I've branded
myself as the unsociable girl!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.820
"Well, even so...
it's only for a little while..."

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:14.120
Kill me! Kill me, please!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.340
As fun as going to Heaven!
Visit Odabutsu Screamland!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.670
Okay, cut!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:21.670
How was that?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.670
Nice and energetic, Sana-chan!
Good, good!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:24.670
Yahoo!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.340
Zenjiro-san, boo! One more time
on the flying carpet.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.680
You're kidding me!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.350
One-two! One-two!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.980
We're boxers! We know no pity!
We're boxers!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.650
Bocari is a hit! Bocari Sweet!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.320
Okay, Sana-chan!
Your "Bocari is a hit" was okay!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.320
Yay!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.280
Zenjiro-san, we need a
close-up of you being hit.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.990
How come?

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.320
O Romeo! Wherefore art thou Romeo?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:52.990
Because my name is Romeo! Juliet,
yours is Juliet, so you're Juliet!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.660
I will go on loving you,
even at the cawst of my own life!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.710
Accident insurance, just in case!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.010
Wishing you a 1000-year-crane,
10,000-year-turtle life!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:07.300
Right, okay! Zenjiro-san, we need to
shoot a close-up of just you falling.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.970
How come!?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.350
Take 20, one more time!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.310
That was no good! One more time!

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:19.350
That's no good! This is
no good at all, Zenjiro-san!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.690
What is the young lady thinking?

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.690
I can't do it no more!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.280
No you don't, Zenjiro-chan. After all,

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:33.370
"Zenjiro's manager,
Higashiyamato Sanekichi-san"

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.570
Sana-chan was good enough

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.620
to share this yummy
commercial work with you.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.620
It's not that yummy!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.290
Zenjiro has reached his limit!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.620
Okay, Rei-kun, onto the next one!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.620
See? Sana-chan is full of life.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.290
At this point, I'm bursting with energy!

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.300
Right, you keep at it, Zenjiro-chan.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.960
No!!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.630
"Zenjiro retires"

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:51.300
Uchiyamada-kun was hired
to take Zenjiro-chan's place!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.300
Wash! Wash! One, two, four!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.640
Ah! Too much came off!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.310
Just kidding!
New Kid's Foam, now on sale!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.640
Okay, cut!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.640
One more time, okay?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.440
Uchiyamada-kun, be more
cuddly and ineffable;

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.320
Sana-chan, wash more
splashily and hootily.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.650
What are you talking about?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.650
--Splash! Hoot!
--Ineffably cuddly!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:08.320
Right, okay!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.990
--Onto the next one! Onto the next one!

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.990
My sweetheart has an ice cream heart!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.990
If you love ice cream, I love you!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.990
Two ice creams are i-ice.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.000
Three ice creams are i-i-ice.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.000
Yummy, cold, and melting, ya!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.000
Delicious a hundred times,
makes my cheeks pucker!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.460
Gleco Gleco Ice Cream!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.340
Right, cut! Okay!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.340
Yahoo! It's okay!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:35.260
Ah, I could do commercials like this over
and over again! I can still eat more!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.260
That's okay, we still have lots!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.020
The summer version is okay.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.940
We still have to shoot autumn,
winter and spring-- four types in all.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:42.600
Four types?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.940
Yay! I can do as many as you like!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.270
The season changes... and start!

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:49.280
In the fall, we feel scholarly,

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.280
work up an appetite,
and lick our ice cream!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.280
Jingle, jingle, snow is falling!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.280
In the winter, ice cream's the best!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.950
Butterflies and flowerbeds!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.910
Every kid loves ice cream!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.000
"Uchiyamada-kun retires"

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:02.960
My stomach hurts.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.630
Hiroshi, are you okay?

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:08.300
He licked up so many of them
while we were shooting...

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.630
Sana-chan, are you okay?

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.300
Completely!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:18.310
Babbit took all the leftover ice cream!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:25.020
I've been so busy...

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:30.110
I haven't even had time to think about
where the love I've lost has gone.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.780
The sparkle of a pearl.
Pearl eye drops.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.620
Say, how was that one?

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.950
Good! Sana-chan, okay!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.290
--Sana-chan, a job well done!
--Nice work, Sana-chan!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.620
Ah! All done! All done!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.960
Sana-chan, nice work.
Here, have a towel.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.750
Suji-san, thanks!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.960
Ooh, it's nice and frosty!
It's cooling me down all over!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:56.390
Sana-chan, nice work. You did well,
just like I knew you would.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.970
Okay then, let's awl blow on
outta here and get some yakiniku!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.310
Meat! Meat!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:07.310
Oh, I got some rest,
and Ah'm feeling bett-uh now.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.980
I took some medicine, and got better.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.320
Well, how 'bout if only we go?

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.650
Um... Yeah.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.610
See you, Sana-chan.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.660
Sana-chan, let's work hard at
this same pace next week, too!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.660
Mm-hmm!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.080
First up next week,
we have two commercials,

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.670
for Hachimitsu Mikanpai,
and Sawayaka Drinks.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.000
Huh?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.920
You booked more commercial work?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.920
Mm-hmm, four more of them.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.010
I mean, with this
strength of yours, Sana-chan,

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.260
I thought that we could keep going,

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.930
ride out this energy you've got now,
and do a bunch in one stretch.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.930
Manager reject!

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.560
Rei-kun, the path to becoming
a great manager is a long one!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.650
This week's Sana-chan,
with Uchiyamada-kun!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.610
In any case, Sana-chan,
get plenty of rest tonight, okay?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.610
That would give me the
muscle tone of a squid.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:59.070
If I act flabby,
then I'm going to be flabby.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.950
Turn left here!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.960
W- where are we going?

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.620
Never mind, just drive
where I tell you. Now...

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.580
Right!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.960
Sana-chan, you're starting to act
a little colder toward me, huh?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.680
I'm not so flavorless a girl as
to treat men that I've broken up with

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.300
too affectionately.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.640
Flavorless? Oh, you mean distasteful.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.300
Turn right!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.300
Now, hold on!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.600
This is dangerous!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.270
Where are we?

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.270
Yes?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.270
Rei!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.400
What's going on? You said we
wouldn't see each other again

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.570
until Sana-chan was an adult,
not long ago.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.240
I've become an adult, madam.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.870
Who are you calling "madam"?

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.580
Sana-chan, by any chance,
are you celebrating with "red" rice?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.580
No, that first happened
a long while back.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.500
Half a year ago.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:55.300
Guess what! I endured some
embarrassment and became an adult!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.170
...or so Mama said.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:03.930
So you see, it's okay.
Go ahead and get back together.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.270
I was thinking it would
take around ten years.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.850
Yeah, me too.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:19.650
Asako-san, you pushed Rei-kun away,
so you could live for your work,

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:23.200
but it turns out you couldn't
completely abandon your womanhood.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.990
--...or so Mama said, right?
--Right.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:29.660
She has abandoned her womanhood,
after all.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.670
But if you had the guts to make your way
inside the Kurata residence,

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:36.340
then you should be able to manage
both your womanhood and your work.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.800
...or so Mama said, right?

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.350
Don't turn away Rei-kun anymore, okay?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.510
Sana-chan...

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:54.360
Okay, I'll go home by myself.
You guys take your time.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.360
Sana-chan...!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.360
Whoops, it's this way.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.650
You scatterbrain!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.570
S- Sana-chan!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.530
You're not going after her?

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:12.250
I'm sure she's going
to become a fine woman.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.360
Fine with me! I'm going to find me
an even better pimp--

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.410
I mean, boyfriend-- than Rei-kun!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:03.880
Father Hayama! Huh? Hold on...

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.430
Sana-chan...

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.220
It is you, Sana-chan. How are you?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:19.110
Oh, on closer look, Father Hayama,
you've gotten so scrawny!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.440
"Skinny."

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.440
--so skinny!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.110
Work has been hard on me.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:26.780
Wow, a package of sushi!
Is that a present?

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:31.120
Akito appears to love sushi.
Do I really look that haggard?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.040
Yeah, skin-and-bones.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.040
But I never knew that Akito likes sushi.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.670
Yes. Akito usually eats quickly,

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:45.050
but one day, when he had some sushi,
he chewed on it an unusually long time.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.050
So I asked him, "Do you like sushi?"

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.720
"I don't hate it," he answered.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.060
His "I don't hate it" would
seem to mean "I love it."

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:57.060
Pop, you're starting to act more
and more like a father, huh?

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.560
"I love it"...?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.820
I don't hate you, that's why.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.410
Sana-chan, care to ride with me?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.410
Oh, no, that's okay. I'm not going far.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.370
You don't say. Okay then, see you later.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:24.090
Huh? What's this?
By that reasoning, that means...

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:27.090
He has a crush on me!?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.430
I see, so if that's why he kissed me,
then it all zebra-tails.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.970
"Dovetails."

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.180
--But that's unthinkable.
--Ah, it's Sana-chan!

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.730
--He's always seeing the
eccentric part of me.
--It's Sana-chan, from TV! She's so cute!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:37.730
--Or maybe he just likes me
on the same level as sushi?
--Sana-chan is distraught.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.560
--Or maybe he just likes me
on the same level as sushi?
--She's being distraught in a strange pose.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.400
--Or maybe he just likes me
on the same level as sushi?
--How funny!

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.230
--If that's the case,
then his kiss was just to taste me?
--Is she rehearsing a part?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.400
--Now that's stupid.
--It looks like she really is distraught.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.730
--If he had a crush on me,
--It looks like she really is distraught.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.610
then there would be sparklers
going off. Pa-pa-pa-pa!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.240
"Hayama"

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.410
The sushi from this place is
exceptionally delicious, huh?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.080
Mm-hmm, delicious!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.750
How about you, Akito?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.460
It's not yucky.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.420
Yikes, what are you choking on, Father?

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.770
Okay, okay, the phone...

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.650
Huh?

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.780
Huh?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.450
The phone...?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.700
Hello, Kurata here. Ah, thanks
for coming over the other day.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.370
Sana, it's for you, from Hayama-kun.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.370
What does he want!?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.370
Don't ask me.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.370
If he does have a crush on me,
I'm going to swell up.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.380
What are you talking about? Hurry up!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.710
Ah, hello. It's me.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:49.340
Anyone there? Hello?
Yohoseyo? Paki nyo ha?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.010
My pop might be dying.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:02.520
What is this!? He's kidding, right?
I just barely saw Father Hayama!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.060
He ate some sushi, and then collapsed.

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:08.690
He coughed up enough blood
to fill a washbasin.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.030
It's not exactly like
he called me there...

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:19.080
And his voice sounded pretty calm...

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.410
Knowing him, he's just being aloof.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.080
Still, I'm concerned about Father Hayama.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.920
Sure enough, I'll go!

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.380
What am I going to do...?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.380
What am I going to do?
What am I going to do?

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.390
Buck up. Usually, you're
so cheerful, it's annoying.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:41.060
Be quiet! What about you!?
How can you be so unconcerned!?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.020
What am I going to do if Father dies?

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.230
How should I know?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.780
Here you are.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:01.080
I'm here! Is your father okay?

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:10.090
If Pop dies, what am I going to do?

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.420
Hayama...

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:15.050
Hayama, be strong.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:21.390
His "I don't hate it"
would seem to mean "I love it."

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:25.440
Father Hayama, no! It can't be...!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:37.990
Hayama, come on. You're the oldest son,
so you've got to keep it together.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.950
Come on, raise those eyebrows.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.370
Where's your sister?

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.960
She's over there.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.380
I have no idea what I should do here.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:56.220
Ordinarily, we say something
all grown-up and know-it-all--

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.720
both Hayama and I...

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:03.310
But we are children, after all--
only half-grown-ups.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.980
It makes you realize...

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:12.770
...at a time like this,
you need to have a grown-up.

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.650
Those of you in Hayama-san's family,
come on in.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.910
"Father Hayama..."

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.410
H- he's all right?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.540
Mm-hmm. Of course, he will
have to stay in the hospital,

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.750
but there's nothing to worry about.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.080
But he coughed up so much blood...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.670
Mm-hmm, it's something that does happen.
He's developed a stomach ulcer.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.670
But your father put up
with it for too long.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.180
He's probably working himself too hard.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.850
So, I want to keep him in the hospital
for 15 days or so

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.680
to monitor his condition...

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:47.350
Um, is there another adult?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:50.520
Oh, uh, I'll go call our aunt.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.030
He's all right. Yeah, thank goodness!

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:58.740
--Thank goodness!
--Thank goodness!

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:04.030
Akito, I'm sorry about this.
Did I startle you?

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.370
Dad was startled, too.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.710
For shame, Father. You have to
make sure you work moderately.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:13.380
Yes, you're right--
oh, Sana-chan, you came, too?

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.380
Babbit came, too!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.710
I really was worried about you.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:18.720
So was I.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.720
Get well soon, okay?

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.390
Yeah, Pop.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.510
Mm-hmm.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.390
"Thank goodness..."

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:31.400
Bye, now. Take good care
of Father Hayama, okay?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.020
Are you--

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:37.690
Are you busy? You must be,
huh, these days?

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.610
Uh, yeah. But only for
a little while longer.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.370
Hayama...

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.370
You've got a crush on me, don't you?

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.370
This is no time to be asking him that!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.040
See ya!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.380
Hayama,

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.720
I'm giving you this.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.390
The vibrating communicator, Burutcha!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:05.720
Burutcha...?

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.390
If anything else comes up, though I doubt
it will, but even if there's nothing,

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:12.730
by making this Burutcha vibrate,
I'll be able to know, whatever it is.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.600
Come on, come on.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.740
See? Okay, then...

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:22.900
Kurata...!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.870
Sorry about all this.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.330
So he's trying to say "thank you," huh!?

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.670
Not at all! You're welcome!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:39.340
Geez, I wish I had an
interpreter when I talk to him.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.300
"Shimura-san is relieved."

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:47.010
Is that so? It wasn't
anything serious, then?

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.970
Say, Mama, are you
all right everywhere?

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:49.680
No problems with anything?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.350
Your mother?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.020
All right, all right.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.350
Just kidding. By the way,
where's Sagami-kun?

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.360
Oh, it's rubber.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.320
I left him over at Asako-san's place.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.360
They're probably making out to their
hearts' delight right now, I'll bet.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.360
Oh, my...

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:08.370
"Farewell, My Pimp"

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.700
It turns out I don't understand much about
boyfriends and being in love and stuff.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.370
I don't need to just yet, huh?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:12.040
Huh? But aren't you
seeing Hayama-kun now?

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.370
What makes you say that!?

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.710
After all, you've already kissed.
Right, Shimura?

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:18.040
And she's getting phone calls
from him too, huh, Sensei?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.710
It's not like that! He did
all of that on his own!

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.050
I'm going to let you
in on something good.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:26.380
Make sure you keep any man
that seems to have a crush on you.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.390
Keep?

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:30.140
Then manipulate him,
right in the palm of your hand.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:33.020
Once he's grown into a good man,
promote him to boyfriend.

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:37.400
H- hold on, that's not something
a good mother would say!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.020
Oh, manipulate men
in the palm of my hand.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.900
Come on, now, that's not something
a good girl would be impressed about,

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:42.730
I tell you!

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.070
Hayama in the palm of my hand!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:48.070
What are you doing? Are you
making fun of me? I'll peck you!

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.740
Yuck! I don't want this! How unlikable!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.240
Amateur.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.620
I'm out of here!

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:01.290
Father, you're looking better,
aren't you?

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.710
Better, better. The hospital
food is good,

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:08.590
but I'd like to have some sake
before too long, you know, Akito?

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:10.050
You can't.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:14.310
I can't huh? You don't say,
you don't say.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.350
Hayama, this is the first time

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:19.940
I've ever seen you earnestly
concerned for your father.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:21.610
That's great.

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.780
Father, get out of
the hospital soon, okay?

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:29.610
You're kidding me, right!?
You booked me for commercial work again!?

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:31.620
Mm-hmm, I was impressed.

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:34.290
There's something remarkable
about your talent, Sana-chan.

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:37.290
Seeing that talent on the
short films of commercials is--

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:39.830
Manager reject!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.070
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:10.920
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:13.590
Sheesh! Rei-kun,
you've booked too much work for me!

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:17.600
I've just done seven commercials,
and you've got me doing four more!?

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:20.930
Okay, let's hammer these out!
But "boo" on doing any more than that!

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:24.270
Ah, I forgot about
Hisae-chan's birthday party!

00:24:24.270 --> 00:24:25.810
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,

00:24:25.810 --> 00:24:29.280
Episode 12 of the "Oh No, Oh No,
We're Not Getting Along" Saga,

00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:34.950
This Time, Sana is the Lonely Wolf
This Time, Sana is the Lonely Wolf
